  1734	# PLAN-113 Phase B B5 — RESERVED-no-producer registry. Each maps a registered
  1735	# `_KNOWN_ACTIONS` member that has ZERO production caller today to its gating
  1736	# ADR. The CI-guard test (test_audit_emit_ghost_action_guard.py) asserts (a)
  1737	# every member here is truly producer-less and (b) if a member ever GROWS a
  1738	# production caller, its gating ADR MUST be in ACCEPTED state — else fail.
  1739	# Verified against SPEC/v1/audit-log.schema.md governing-ADR columns:
  1740	#   - execution_context_* : ADR-133 §D (cross-process wiring DEFERRED, F-1.2)
