  2501	    Truncates to 32 chars then fails OPEN to the common-case
  2502	    ``size_threshold`` for any value outside ``_VALID_ROTATION_TRIGGERS``.
  2503	    Fail-open (never raises) matches the audit-emit contract — the marker
  2504	    must still be written on rotation.
  2505	    """
  2506	    s = str(value)[:32]
  2507	    if s not in _VALID_ROTATION_TRIGGERS:
  2508	        return "size_threshold"
  2509	    return s
