  2808	                # shared rotation primitive BEFORE computing the HMAC.
  2809	                # If rotation happens, reset the chain sidecar so the next
  2810	                # write re-anchors at genesis in the new (empty) file.
  2811	                # Fail-open: any rotation exception is breadcrumbed and
  2812	                # the write proceeds against the over-threshold log.
