  4192	    Called by ``_lib/ledger_provenance._emit_rejection``; the keyword names
  4193	    mirror ``GateVerdict.to_audit_fields()`` EXACTLY, because that caller
  4194	    splats the dict (``typed(**fields)``) and a signature mismatch would
  4195	    look like a raising emitter and degrade the rail silently.
