  8182	# ADR-110-AMEND-2 §1.6 — shared bound for the pair-rail effective-budget
  8183	# field. 6_000_000 ms = 6000 s = 10x the hook's own 600 s clamp ceiling:
  8184	# wide enough that a legitimate value is never distorted, tight enough
  8185	# that a direct emit_generic caller cannot sign an unbounded number.
