  8953	    8 chars total). Anything else — including path-traversal attempts
  8954	    smuggled through a spoofed plan_transition audit event — is rejected
  8955	    and the caller coerces to the safe sentinel ``"unknown"``. Kept as a
  8956	    plain string check (no regex) to preserve audit_emit's import
  8957	    surface.
  8958	    """
  8959	    if not isinstance(value, str) or len(value) != 8:
  8960	        return False
  8961	    return value.startswith("PLAN-") and value[5:].isdigit()
