 13932	    claim_id.
 13933	
 13934	    verdict is the closed enum {pass, fail, refuted}; invalid values
 13935	    dropped to 'fail' (P1-1 fold — NOT 'refuted', because backfill
 13936	    treats 'refuted' as an FP signal and a parser-sentinel must NOT
 13937	    pollute the FPR numerator).
