 13939	    was_false_positive is the boolean PLAN-100 baseline analysis
 13940	    consumes (paired with claim_id to compute FPR per class). PLAN-090-
 13941	    FOLLOWUP shipping rule (P0-1 fold — no chicken-and-egg with PLAN-
 13942	    100 drift detector):
