   437	  flips the per-machine autonomy posture (`permissions.defaultMode`
   438	  overlay in the gitignored `.claude/settings.local.json`) with
   439	  next-session semantics — "arm before sleep, autonomous overnight
   440	  session, disarm in the morning". The tracked `settings.json` posture is
