   482	### Changed — hook-deadline doctrine settled by ADR-186 (fail-CLOSED)
   483	
   484	- The canonical-edit matcher now enforces a **per-invocation wall
   485	  deadline that fails CLOSED** (`_HOOK_WALL_BUDGET_S`, injectable clock),
   486	  replacing the unbounded sentinel sweep — and the published
   487	  fail-open-on-infrastructure contract in `CLAUDE.md` §4 / `AGENTS.md` §1
   488	  now names this exception explicitly: a timeout *inside the matcher* is
